  "notes": "Drawn from N933AK's right side (2025-09-06 and 2026-02-27) and checked on the left in Alaska's own photo: the left side carries the same layout, so nothing is marked by side. Replaced the 2021 Kraken jet N915AK, which is back in standard colors; N915AK's 2021 design was different (white body with 'SEATTLE KRAKEN' titles over the windows and a smaller S with its eye at the aft door, per a 2022 Commons photo), so this geometry fits N933AK only. Re-checked 2026-11-15 (drawn on the 737-9): the cyan swoosh and the lime stripe behind it curve, made smooth; the three leaning bands and the red stripe are straight as seen from the side and kept as corners only. Titles' lengths kept; 'Alaska' lowercase about 0.55 of its A.",
  "from": "2024-10",
